# RQ2 v4 P4/P5 campaign pins (R1/R2, D15) — merged on EVERY campaign run via
# the launcher's extra_env_file argument. Values match today's platform
# defaults: pinning is provenance, not a behavior change. The BA delta
# (rq2v4_p3_scalepolicy_ba.env) is NOT used in-campaign (per-window per-tier
# scores come from the post-run policy_state.csv reconstruction, R2).
